<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Luxottica said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Luxottica said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns downgraded Luxottica Group SpA to neutral from attractive, a source at Bear Stearns said.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Connie Maneaty later confirmed the rating action.</p>
<p>-- Cut fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $3.25 per share from $3.55.</p>
<p>-- Cited expected earnings impact of the company's planned new store openings.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
